# Without this file the build context was 2.09 GB: `COPY . .` in the Dockerfile
# shipped node_modules, the Next build cache, the Mongo data directory and the
# local audio files into the image. It also made the build fail outright, since
# the context walker cannot read certbot's root-owned account directory.
#
# Note that server/.env is deliberately NOT excluded: the Dockerfile copies it
# to .env.local.

.git
.gitignore

# Reinstalled by `npm i` inside the image, and platform-specific besides.
node_modules
.next
out
*.tsbuildinfo

# Runtime state written by the stack, not source.
server/data1
server/certbot
server/nginx/certs
server/agents/dataCollection/data
server/agents/.venv
**/__pycache__
*.pyc

# Local media and scratch material.
*.wav
*.ogg
*.webm
*.aup
tests
reference_data

# Local agent guidance, never part of an image.
CLAUDE.md
